xperience a charming and lively narrative where the rules are constantly changing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A jazzy, big-band soundtrack that keeps the energy pumping throughout</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/3f816268e4bc20389e8dde9b981259db.poster.avif?t=1738113955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/3f816268e4bc20389e8dde9b981259db.webm?t=1738113955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/3f816268e4bc20389e8dde9b981259db.mp4?t=1738113955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
